                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>For a summary of the comments made by Major General Thomas J. H. Trapnell, Jr.,
                    former Chief of the Military Assistance Advisory Group (MAAG) Indochina, at his
                    debriefing, May 3, 1954, see <hi rendition="#italic">United States–Vietnam
                        Relations, 1945–1967</hi>, Book 9, pages 406–420.</p>
            </div>
